From b518eeaafce6cc8e8bd29442030ad261de630b0b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vasiliy Yorkin <vasiliy.yorkin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:05:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: let one pane override direct keybinding routing

keys.direct_keys covers every pane; a pane that needs the other behaviour
needs a per-pane escape hatch. `herdr pane direct-keys` sets it, served by a
new pane.direct_keys.set method so the published pane.input.set shape stays
untouched. The override lives in PaneState and travels to the client with the
shell snapshot, and the client prefers it over the config value.
